#   flex_formatting_context_4 - Layout::FlexFormattingContext: cross sizes, main-axis
#                               alignment and cross-axis alignment of the items
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/FlexFormattingContext.cpp (lines 1194-1643): the hypothetical
#       cross size of an item, the cross size of each flex line, the used cross size of each
#       item (stretching), distributing the remaining free space along the main axis
#       (auto margins and justify-content), the debug dump of the items, an item's effective
#       align-self, aligning the items along the cross axis, and the baseline alignment that
#       runs after the items are laid out.
